Repealed by No I 14 of the FA of 17 Dec. 2021 on the Harmonisation of Secondary Criminal Law with the Amended Law on Sanctions, with effect from 1 July 2023 (AS 2023 254; BBl 2018 2827).

:PATH
5. Criminal proceedings
|

